! Shanta.ascl
!
Shanta in F - Nadi (just intonation). Nadi's own tuning, named for the rasa of stillness. Shuddha Re, Ma, Pa, Dha, Ni.
!
 6
!
 9/8
 4/3
 3/2
 5/3
 15/8
 2/1
!
! Scale degrees (the annotations that used to sit on the pitch lines):
!   Re    203.91 cents
!   Ma    498.04 cents
!   Pa    701.96 cents
!   Dha   884.36 cents
!   Ni   1088.27 cents
!   Sa'  1200.00 cents
!
! Matches Nadi's internal tuning exactly, so instruments in this tuning
! and Nadi's resonators lock together instead of beating.
